{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f18b89a8f18b70bc843b46f8fee165953c67f776b30dc10e52a17d693898ce0", "ja": "（雪歩達の公演も終わり、今日は溜まった事務仕事を\n片付けている……よし、少し休憩するかな）", "zh": "（雪步她们的公演也结束了，今天正在处理积攒下来的事务工作……好，稍微休息一下吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "48a66b15ca2ec44cf56d2cfdba352ca66b9e194d4cc5c9a3bedcda654596e4d1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a1ae5b343a62930e15b2aa082806945c32c225ec8ba8d09e3654764bb9d9b813", "ja": "あれっ？　雪歩か、お疲れさま。\nこんなところで、何してるんだ？", "zh": "咦？是雪步啊，辛苦了。\n你在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ec8b0d74cacfbd905c14dda5b899611d2035b4038e5761b9db12f6587f5bc78d", "ja": "さっき、レッスンが終わったところで……\n{$P$}は、お仕事の休憩ですか？", "zh": "刚才刚结束训练……\n{$P$}先生是在工作间隙休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9c3f2c3b0811f4cc6c1b03c22a24f700e3a3d1e46c7a8c5db919ea73434424b0", "ja": "うん、まだまだ片付かなくてな……。\n後半戦の前に、少しお茶でも飲もうと思って。", "zh": "嗯，还没忙完呢……\n我想着在下半场开始前，先喝点茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1f9c7ebe02722101cb3501d5e7fd4b461ba43b2b716f188cc39e3a793fd9f360", "ja": "それなら、私が淹れますね。\nとっておきの、美味しいお菓子もあるんですよ♪", "zh": "那样的话，我来泡吧。\n我还准备了特别好吃的点心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "09f08d21bd8be80774b70390199b352adc9ded7e84b21a708ecaff7de83bb39e", "ja": "すこしだけ、待っててくださいね。\n……あっ。そうだ、えっと。", "zh": "请稍微等我一下哦。\n……啊，对了，那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "77c5f0ccde431e45da18a271fa04da0a8aa193ab3a4470bfb95a353c7aa644d6", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\nカスタマイズのご注文はありませんか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n您有什么定制要求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8e6e9f3d00ccaf517597dc7d79ed2e7f031a54a69591fc6e5927b1a78c042a33", "ja": "えっ、カスタマイズ……？", "zh": "咦，定制……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "99764ac03f67157fe99df9110876d930f119f7963e9c16e05de69058b86db1fd", "ja": "はい！　コーヒーショップの店員さんのお仕事を\nしてから、なんだか楽しくなってきちゃって……。", "zh": "是的！自从体验过咖啡店店员的工作后，不知不觉觉得越来越有意思了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "99f63675bc38b8aad58e17e48b7feaa52963b6dd79a10d85b7ce41a5c4bbaa0c", "ja": "{$P$}好みの味に近づけますので、\n遠慮なく言ってみてください！", "zh": "我会尽量调成符合{$P$}喜好的口味，\n请尽管提出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1012_p", "source_sha256": "61338a8571e0989f31844380e814741dfa58fe224822078d045776d924923bfb", "ja": "でも、雪歩が淹れてくれるのって、\nだいたい日本茶だよな？", "zh": "不过，雪步泡给我的，\n基本上都是日本茶吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a685bd91cf33911508ebbef23eed4d9dd03926db57af9dfd97d49e4a14532ffa", "ja": "はい！　日本茶は温めが基本ですけど、\n熱いほうがお好きなら、熱いお茶にしますし……。", "zh": "是的！日本茶一般以温热为主，不过如果您喜欢热一点的，我也会泡热茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6e1541838bb0f6562958a8752db155827484178b91fede16b3cb76f8862ced40", "ja": "冷たいお水で冷茶とか、煎茶以外にも、\nほうじ茶や麦茶、抹茶なんかもありますから♪", "zh": "用凉水泡的冷茶之类的，除了煎茶以外，还有焙茶、麦茶、抹茶什么的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "42e2ab51ad3f10a2de4789770f524db7c7f8574457b195e2f9322c420428ac78", "ja": "はっ！？　そ、それとも{$P$}、\nもしかして……。", "zh": "啊！？难、难道说{$P$}，该不会…… encapsed 。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1016_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e8e6883d2c45fe63d63a1f6873462b17e787b41912e596181b5ed51cf9a0c365", "ja": "今まで、無理してお茶に付き合ってくれてたんですか？\n私、そんなこと想像もしてなくて……。", "zh": "之前，你一直是在勉强自己陪我喝茶吗？\n我完全没想到会是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8edbc29143176712f28766597703ef7e266a9ca4f01897bfadbd71153455e3d1", "ja": "いやいや、そんな事はないから！　ただ、日本茶の\nカスタマイズが想像できなかっただけだよ。", "zh": "不不不，没那回事！只是我没想到日本茶还能定制而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a3edc0b1a93d4ae9e9ad88edf76db41a5d1b7235b28073f38cef16c0df26b690", "ja": "けど確かに、言われてみればお茶にも色々あるんだな。\n紅茶だってお茶なわけだし……。", "zh": "不过仔细想想，茶确实也有各种各样的呢。毕竟红茶也是茶嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9977f0bcd19700a44f441d698ca8710d588df0117e1f4cd8e95fb6d1978fa49f", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんです。というわけで、\nお客様、ご注文はどうなさいますか？　なんて。", "zh": "嘿嘿，没错。所以说，客人，您想点些什么呢？开个玩笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1021_p", "source_sha256": "98c005cedd33b4d2c7713b3b22722614151911958d63c27ae06aca505feb847f", "ja": "そうだな……なら、バリスタさんにおまかせするよ。\n雪歩のお茶は、いつも美味いしな！", "zh": "是啊……那就拜托咖啡师了。  \n雪步泡的茶，一直都很好喝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3b416c1297f024bc496c428f70420d391852ddbf36a88bfb40c29b546e9b3be9", "ja": "{$P$}……はいっ！　えっと、お茶は\nほうじ茶がいいかな？　お菓子はどら焼きにして……♪", "zh": "{$P$}……好的！那个，茶的话，焙茶怎么样？点心就选铜锣烧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0183_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e4249baf4ffe37c6a5539f953e7b5c4e6e368cf9d9af53a91fc324b04e65aa85", "ja": "（これは、いいティータイムになりそうだな。\n残りの仕事も、頑張れそうだ！）", "zh": "（感觉会是一次很棒的下午茶时间。剩下的工作也能努力完成了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
